{"unit":1,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 1","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 1 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Your story</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 1&ndash;4: was/were and the Past Simple. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u1\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ born in Astana.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">were</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">did</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">They ___ at school yesterday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">were</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Where ___ you last night?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">were</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Last night I ___ a film.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">watched</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">watches</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">watch</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ to work by bus yesterday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">goes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">went</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">goed</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">We ___ dinner at eight.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">haved</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">had</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ me a funny story. (tell)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">tells</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">telled</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">told</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ my keys at last! (find)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">founds</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">finded</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">found</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ go out last night.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">didn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wasn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">___ you see the film?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Were</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Did you go to the beach? — Yes, I ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">went</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ happy about the news. (negative, be)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">weren't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">didn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wasn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">say → ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">says</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">sayed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">said</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">meet → ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">meeted</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">met</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">mets</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">give → ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">gave</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gives</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">gived</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: I was at work.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I wasn't at work.|I was not at work.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Make it past: I finish work at six.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I finished work at six.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You went to the beach.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Did you go to the beach?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: I didn't went out.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I didn't go out.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Make it past: We do our homework.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"We did our homework.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She were a doctor.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She was a doctor.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}